---
---
<section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-paper-300">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="absolute -top-32 -left-32 w-96 h-96 bg-accent-600/20 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-1/3 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-accent-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute -bottom-32 left-1/3 w-96 h-96 bg-[#131d60]/40 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 opacity-[0.07]" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg width="100%" height="100%">
      <defs>
        <pattern id="grid" width="32" height="32" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
          <path d="M 32 0 L 0 0 0 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"/>
        </pattern>
      </defs>
      <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#grid)" />
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pt-20 pb-24 md:pt-28 md:pb-32">
    <div class="w-12 h-0.5 bg-accent-500/70 rounded-full mb-6"></div>
    <p class="text-base text-ink-500 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
      Extend your edge.<br />Secure every identity.
    </p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-semibold leading-[1.05] max-w-4xl">
      External identity lifecycle,
      <span class="text-accent-500">governed.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg md:text-xl text-ink-500 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
      EdgeSecura provisions, certifies, and offboards every contractor, partner,
      and vendor across your stack. One audit-ready record per identity. Built
      on zero-trust principles, integrated with the directories and SaaS apps
      you already run.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
      <a
        href="#cta"
        class="inline-flex items-center px-5 py-2.5 rounded-md bg-ink-900 text-paper-50 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-ink-700 transition-colors"
      >
        Request a demo
      </a>
      <a
        href="#how-it-works"
        class="inline-flex items-center px-5 py-2.5 rounded-md border border-paper-300 text-ink-700 text-sm font-medium hover:border-ink-300 transition-colors"
      >
        Read the architecture →
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-8 gap-y-3 text-xs text-ink-300 uppercase tracking-wider">
      <span>SOC 2 Type II</span>
      <span class="text-ink-300/60">/</span>
      <span>GDPR-ready</span>
      <span class="text-ink-300/60">/</span>
      <span>ISO 27001 (in progress)</span>
      <span class="text-ink-300/60">/</span>
      <span>Zero-trust by design</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
